{
  "book": "Psa", "book_id": 19, "chapter": 18, "provenance": "reread-psalms-2026",
  "note": "Char-driven re-read Ps18 (large; David's deliverance song). Movements: racham love + chasah refuge -> distress/qara -> theophany (charah anger, aph nostrils) -> rescue (chaphets God delighted) -> tsedeq/bor righteousness-reward -> reciprocity (chasid/chasad, barar, ani/rum) -> battle empowerment (tamim, anvah gentleness made me great) -> doxology (rum, naqam, yadah/zamar, chesed). Poetic ledger; span-id pairs; source/effect Phase-2.",
  "spans": {
    "274912": {"gloss":"love v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"love (racham - womb/compassion love, here toward God)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":274912,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"love"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD, his strength","to":274912,"res":"inferred"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I LOVE you (racham), O LORD, my strength' — the psalm's opening; racham normally = a mother's/God's tender compassion, here rare as human love directed TO God; the deepest visceral attachment, love welling from the delivered heart"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "274972": {"gloss":"take refuge v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"take refuge (chasah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":274972,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"take refuge"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (rock)","to":274972,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my rock, in whom I TAKE REFUGE (chasah)' — refuge amid the cascade of God-names (rock/fortress/deliverer/shield/horn); chasah the personal act inside the piled metaphors of safety"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274975": {"gloss":"salvation(horn) v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation (yesha - 'horn of my salvation')"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David (God his salvation)","to":274975,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the HORN of my SALVATION (yesha)' — God as the strength-emblem that saves; first of many yesha/yasha facets in the psalm (contrast v35 shield of salvation, v50 great salvation)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275042": {"gloss":"call v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"call upon (qara)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275042,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"call upon"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD, worthy to be praised","from":275042,"to":275044,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I CALL (qara) upon the LORD, worthy to be praised' — invocation joined to praise; the settled habit of the rescued, calling on the praiseworthy One (distinct from v6's qara out of distress)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275044": {"gloss":"praised v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"praise / be worthy of praise (halal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (as praiseworthy)","to":275044,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the One called upon","from":275044,"to":275042,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"the LORD 'worthy to be PRAISED (halal)' — the object of invocation named by his praiseworthiness; the ground of confident calling"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275045": {"gloss":"saved v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be saved (yasha, niphal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275045,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"be saved (from enemies)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I am SAVED (yasha) from my enemies' — the outcome of calling; deliverance as the answered result, stated before the long recital that unfolds how"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275203": {"gloss":"called v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"call upon (qara, in distress)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275203,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"call upon (in distress)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":275203,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"in my distress","to":275203,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'In my distress I CALLED (qara)... he heard my voice' — the cry from the cords of death; qara here born of anguish (contrast v3's habitual praise-call), and it reaches God's temple"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275222": {"gloss":"trembled v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"tremble / quake (ragaz)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foundations of the mountains","to":275222,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"tremble / quake"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"because he was angry","to":275222,"res":"inferred"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:thing"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"the mountains' foundations TREMBLED (ragaz) 'because he was angry' — creation's fear-response to divine wrath; the cosmos itself quaking, the theophany's terror-register"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "306053": {"gloss":"nostrils v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"nostrils / anger (aph)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"God's nostrils (seat of wrath)","to":306053,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":306053,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'smoke went up from his NOSTRILS (aph)' — the anthropomorphic seat of God's anger; aph = nostrils as the very organ of wrath, smoke and devouring fire the burning of divine indignation"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274937": {"gloss":"nostrils v15","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"nostrils / anger (aph)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"God's nostrils (seat of wrath)","to":274937,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":274937,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'at the BLAST of the breath of your NOSTRILS (aph)' — the sea's channels laid bare by the wind of God's wrath; aph again as the wrath-organ, now the storm-breath that uncovers the deep"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274949": {"gloss":"hated v17","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hate (sane - those who hated me)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the enemies","to":274949,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"hate"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":274949,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"too mighty for me","to":274949,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'from those who HATED (sane) me, for they were too mighty' — the enmity God rescues from; sane = settled hostility, the human hatred behind the deadly threat (recurs v40)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274964": {"gloss":"delighted v19","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"delight in (chaphets)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":274964,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"delight in"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David ('in me')","to":274964,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he rescued me, because he DELIGHTED (chaphets) in me' — the affectional ground of the whole rescue; God's pleasure in David, not David's strength, is the reason for deliverance"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274980": {"gloss":"righteousness v20","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"righteousness (tsedeq)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":274980,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with cleanness of hands","from":274980,"to":274982,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'dealt with me according to my RIGHTEOUSNESS (tsedeq)' — the reward-principle opening; tsedeq here = David's covenant integrity, the moral ground God honours (restated v24)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274982": {"gloss":"cleanness v20","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"cleanness / purity (bor - of hands)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":274982,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with righteousness","from":274982,"to":274980,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'according to the CLEANNESS (bor) of my hands he rewarded me' — purity of conduct, the outward hands mirroring the inward righteousness; the two paired as the basis of reward (v20, v24)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274991": {"gloss":"departed v21","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"act wickedly / depart (rasha, negated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":274991,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"depart wickedly (negated)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"from my God","to":274991,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"negated ('have NOT wickedly departed from my God')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I have kept the ways of the LORD, and have not wickedly DEPARTED (rasha) from my God' — loyalty stated as the absence of apostasy; rasha negated = the fidelity underlying the righteousness-claim"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275005": {"gloss":"blameless v23","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"blameless / whole (tamim)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275005,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"before him","to":275005,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with keeping from guilt","from":275005,"to":275010,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I was BLAMELESS (tamim) before him, and I kept myself from my guilt' — integrity as wholeness before God; tamim (of the man here) will be echoed of God's own way (v30) and of the way God makes (v32)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275010": {"gloss":"guilt v23","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"guilt / iniquity (avon)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David (kept from it)","to":275010,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"kept himself from it","from":275010,"to":275005,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"guarded-against ('I kept myself from my guilt')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I kept myself from my GUILT (avon)' — vigilant self-guarding against iniquity; avon = the crookedness he refuses, the active side of blamelessness"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275013": {"gloss":"righteousness v24","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"righteousness (tsedeq)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275013,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with cleanness (v24)","from":275013,"to":275015,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'rewarded me according to my RIGHTEOUSNESS (tsedeq)' — the inclusio closing the reward-section (v20 reopened); the repetition frames the whole moral argument"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275015": {"gloss":"cleanness v24","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"cleanness (bor - of hands, in his sight)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275015,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"in his sight","to":275015,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with righteousness","from":275015,"to":275013,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'CLEANNESS (bor) of my hands in his sight' — purity now qualified 'in his sight'; the reward measured by God's own seeing, not human reckoning"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275020": {"gloss":"merciful(man) v25","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"merciful / loyal (chasid)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the merciful man","to":275020,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"God shows himself merciful to him","from":275020,"to":275021,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'with the MERCIFUL (chasid) you show yourself merciful' — the reciprocity principle; the chasid (covenant-loyal, chesed-bearing man) meets God's answering chesed; character mirrored back by God"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275021": {"gloss":"merciful(God) v25","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"show oneself merciful (chasad)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":275021,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"show oneself merciful"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the merciful man","from":275021,"to":275020,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"toward the chasid","from":275021,"to":275020,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'you SHOW YOURSELF MERCIFUL (chasad)' — God reflecting the man's chesed; the verb from the same root as chasid, the reciprocity made verbal: God becomes to us what we are toward him"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275023": {"gloss":"blameless v25","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"blameless (tamim)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the blameless man","to":275023,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"God shows himself blameless to him","to":275023,"res":"inferred"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'with the BLAMELESS (tamim) you show yourself blameless' — tamim in the reciprocity series; God meets integrity with integrity, the second rung of the mirror-principle"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "306093": {"gloss":"purified v26","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"purified (barar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the purified man","to":306093,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"God shows himself pure to him","from":306093,"to":306094,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'with the PURIFIED (barar) you show yourself pure' — the third rung; barar = refined/clean, God answering purity with purity in the escalating reciprocity"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "306094": {"gloss":"pure v26","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"show oneself pure (barar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":306094,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"show oneself pure"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the purified man","from":306094,"to":306093,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"toward the purified","from":306094,"to":306093,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"God 'SHOWS himself PURE (barar)' — the divine side of the purity-mirror; the reciprocity turning on how a man comes to God"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "306096": {"gloss":"crooked v26","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"crooked / perverse (iqqesh)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the crooked man","to":306096,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"God makes himself tortuous to him","to":306096,"res":"inferred"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'with the CROOKED (iqqesh) you make yourself seem tortuous' — the dark pole of the reciprocity; to the twisted, God's dealings appear twisted; the moral mirror cuts both ways, the perverse meeting a God who resists them"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275027": {"gloss":"save v27","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"save (yasha)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":275027,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"save"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"a humble people","from":275027,"to":275028,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"contrasted with bringing down the haughty","from":275027,"to":275030,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'you SAVE (yasha) a humble people, but the haughty eyes you bring down' — God's saving bent toward the lowly; yasha directed by disposition, the humble rescued and the proud abased"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275028": {"gloss":"humble v27","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"humble / afflicted (ani)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"a humble people","to":275028,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the ones God saves","from":275028,"to":275027,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"the HUMBLE (ani - lowly/afflicted) people God saves — the disposition that draws rescue; ani = the bowed-down, opposite of the haughty eyes"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275030": {"gloss":"haughty v27","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"haughty / lofty (rum - haughty eyes)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the proud","to":275030,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"brought down (vs the saved humble)","from":275030,"to":275028,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the HAUGHTY (rum) eyes you bring down' — pride imaged in lifted eyes; rum = the self-exalting God abases, the foil to the humble he saves"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275050": {"gloss":"perfect v30","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"perfect / blameless (tamim - God's way)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (his way)","to":275050,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'This God - his way is PERFECT (tamim)' — the same word used of David's integrity (v23) now of God himself; the blameless man reflects a blameless God, and God is a shield to all who take refuge"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275056": {"gloss":"take refuge v30","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"take refuge (chasah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"all those who take refuge in him","to":275056,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"take refuge"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"God (a shield)","to":275056,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he is a shield for all those who TAKE REFUGE (chasah) in him' — the refuge widened from David (v2) to all; chasah now a universal invitation, God the shield of every sheltering soul"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275074": {"gloss":"blameless v32","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"blameless (tamim - the way God makes)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David (his way, made so by God)","to":275074,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the God who... made my way BLAMELESS (tamim)' — the third tamim: the man's blamelessness (v23) is now revealed as God's gift; integrity equipped from above, not self-produced"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275091": {"gloss":"salvation(shield) v35","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation (yesha - shield of your salvation)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (given to David)","to":275091,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with gentleness that made him great","from":275091,"to":275094,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the shield of your SALVATION (yesha)' — salvation as a defensive gift; yesha now the armour given, set beside the astonishing 'your gentleness made me great'"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275094": {"gloss":"gentleness v35","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"gentleness / condescension (anvah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":275094,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"make great","to":275094,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David ('made me great')","to":275094,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the shield of salvation","from":275094,"to":275091,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'your GENTLENESS (anvah) made me great' — a gem: God's condescension/humility, his stooping down, is what exalts the man; the paradox that divine lowliness lifts, greatness born of God's gentle bending to us"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275127": {"gloss":"hated v40","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hate (sane - those who hated me)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the enemies","to":275127,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"hate"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275127,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'those who HATED (sane) me I destroyed' — the same hatred of v17 now overcome; sane recurs to close the arc, the hostility that once was 'too mighty' now under his feet"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "306112": {"gloss":"save v41","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"save (yasha - none to save)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"none (there was none)","res":"none"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"save (none available)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the enemies","to":306112,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"absent ('there was none to save; the LORD did not answer them')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"the enemies 'cried for help, but there was none to SAVE (yasha)' — yasha withheld; the dark counterpart to David's answered cry (v6), the wicked's unanswered plea"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275138": {"gloss":"known v43","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"know (yada - people I had not known)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275138,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with their serving","from":275138,"to":275139,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'people whom I had not KNOWN (yada) served me' — the reach of the deliverance; strangers subdued, the unknown nations bowing, the scope of God-given dominion"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275139": {"gloss":"served v43","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"serve (avad)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the nations","to":275139,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"serve"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","from":275139,"to":275138,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"the unknown peoples SERVED (avad) him — submission of the nations; avad = the servile obedience of the conquered, the fruit of God's vindication"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275157": {"gloss":"exalted v46","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be exalted (rum - the God of my salvation)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (exalted by David's praise)","to":275157,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"be exalted"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the God of my salvation","from":275157,"to":275160,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'EXALTED (rum) be the God of my salvation' — rum turned Godward in doxology; the same verb that abased the haughty (v27) now lifts God; man exalts the One who alone may be high"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275160": {"gloss":"salvation v46","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation (yesha - God of my salvation)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David (God his salvation)","to":275160,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with exalted","from":275160,"to":275157,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the God of my SALVATION (yesha)' — yesha as a title of God in the doxology; the horn of salvation (v2) now confessed as God's very identity"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275163": {"gloss":"vengeance v47","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"vengeance (naqam)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (gives it to David)","to":275163,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"give vengeance","to":275163,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275163,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the God who gave me VENGEANCE (naqam)' — retribution as God's gift, not David's private revenge; naqam here is judicial, the vindication of the wronged executed through the king"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275172": {"gloss":"exalted v48","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"exalt / lift high (rum)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":275172,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"exalt"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David ('above those who rose against me')","to":275172,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'you EXALTED (rum) me above those who rose against me' — God lifts the man above his foes; rum now of David, exalted by God (contrast the self-exalting haughty of v27 whom God casts down)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275180": {"gloss":"praise v49","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"praise / give thanks (yadah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275180,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"praise / give thanks"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (among the nations)","to":275180,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"among the nations","to":275180,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with singing","from":275180,"to":275183,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I will PRAISE (yadah) you, O LORD, among the nations' — thanksgiving carried out to the peoples; yadah = public confession of God's deeds, the delivered man become witness"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275183": {"gloss":"sing v49","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"sing praise (zamar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":275183,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"sing praise"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"God's name","to":275183,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with praise","from":275183,"to":275180,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and SING (zamar) to your name' — the musical praise completing the thanksgiving; zamar paired with yadah, word and song together, the full doxological response"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275192": {"gloss":"salvation v50","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation / deliverances (yeshuah - great salvation)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (brings it to his king)","to":275192,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"his king","to":275192,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with steadfast love to the anointed","from":275192,"to":275195,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'GREAT SALVATION (yeshuah) he brings to his king' — the psalm's final yesha-family word, now the sum of all deliverances; salvation crowned as God's covenant gift to the anointed line"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "275195": {"gloss":"steadfast love v50","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"steadfast love (chesed)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God","to":275195,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"show","to":275195,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"his anointed (David and his offspring forever)","to":275195,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"forever","to":275195,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with great salvation","from":275195,"to":275192,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'shows CHESED (steadfast love) to his anointed, to David and his offspring forever' — the psalm closes on covenant loyalty; the chesid-reciprocity of v25 grounded finally in God's everlasting chesed to the messianic line"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "274914": {"gloss":"strength v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"strength (chezeq - 'my strength')"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v1: 'O LORD, my STRENGTH (chezeq)' - God named as the psalmist's personal strength, the object of his racham-love; the confession that his power is not his own"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "275226": {"gloss":"angry v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be angry / burn (charah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v7: the earth reeled 'because he was ANGRY (charah)' - the divine wrath that triggers the theophany; charah = the kindling/burning of anger, paired with the smoke of his nostrils (v8)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "275123": {"gloss":"assailed v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"assail / terrify (ba'ath - torrents of destruction)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v4-5: 'the cords of death encompassed me; the torrents of destruction ASSAILED (ba'ath) me' - the terror of near-death that presses the cry; the inner experience of being overwhelmed, snares of Sheol confronting the soul"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "306068": {"gloss":"wind v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wind (ruach - wings of the wind)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v10: 'he came swiftly on the WINGS of the WIND (ruach)' - ruach here literal wind, not the inner spirit; noted for lemma-distinction (the same word bears the inner sense elsewhere), the storm-swiftness of God's descent"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "275112": {"gloss":"strength v39","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"strength / might (chayil - for the battle)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v39: 'you equipped me with STRENGTH (chayil) for the battle' - the war-strength God girds on; distinct from v1's chezeq (God as his strength) - here the enabling might poured into the man for combat"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "275148": {"gloss":"lost heart v45","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"fade / lose heart (nabel)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v44-45: foreigners 'came cringing' and 'LOST HEART (nabel) and came trembling out of their fortresses' - the enemy's inner collapse; fear and failing courage as the subdued nations' response, the inverse of David's confidence"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "306121": {"gloss":"wind v42","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wind (ruach - as dust before the wind)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v42: 'I beat them fine as dust before the WIND (ruach)' - ruach again literal (the scattering wind); noted for the lemma record, the totality of the enemy's dispersal"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]}
  }
}
